ONTOLOGY  —  ontology/  —  CC BY 4.0
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The CENSO vocabulary, its SHACL shapes and the regulation packages under
ontology/reg/ are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International Licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Regulation packages transcribe values from legal texts that are themselves
public documents. The transcription, its structure and its provenance
annotations are what is licensed here; the underlying legal text is not
owned by anyone in this repository.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MEASUREMENTS  —  Data/  —  NOT REDISTRIBUTED
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The measurements are third-party data and are not covered by the licences
above. They are not redistributed with this repository.

What the pipeline reads is the European Environment Agency's Waterbase —
Water Quality ICM, which the EEA distributes under its own terms:

  https://www.eea.europa.eu/en/datahub/datahubitem-view/fbf3717c-cd7b-4785-933a-d0cf510542e1

README.md names the files to take and where to put them. The legal texts under
refs/ are likewise not ours: they are free from EUR-Lex and the Resmî Gazete,
and are cited rather than redistributed.
